LAST_SUCCESS=Task 35 fully done 2026-05-26 — end-to-end app installer + thin loader device-verified on Pixel 2 XL. CLI: `wart-host --install <warpkg>` (lib.rs::install_warpkg) + `wart-host --standalone --app <id>` (standalone::run takes Option<&str>). WART_APPS_ROOT env override on both default_for_target() to skirt /data/wart sepolicy for smoke. Smoke fixture script: scripts/smoke-warpkg.sh. Device smoke verified: (1) install at /data/local/tmp/wart-apps/com.example.smoke/0.0.1/ with layout {package.toml, components/ui.wasm, cache/ui.cwasm, cache-key.toml — wasmtime_version + engine_config_hash + per-component sha256s exactly per scope}; (2) standalone --app loads via AppRef::Installed → "loader: cache fresh" → "loaded installed:com.example.smoke:0.0.1:ui" → component instantiated → Compose frames render; (3) drift self-heal — deleted cwasm triggers "loader: cache drift … re-precompiling" + ~42s on-device Cranelift AOT + cache-key.toml re-stamp + normal load. All 12 task-35 dead-code warnings cleared; only 8 pre-existing warnings remain.
NOTES=Task 35 closed. Possible follow-ups (not required, not started): (a) wkg / Warg transport (scope §"Out of scope"); (b) Q5b signing format + verify_signature impl; (c) install update/rollback policy (side-by-side is already supported); (d) deploy script for the install flow (scripts/install-warpkg-on-device.sh wrapping push+install with sensible defaults); (e) cross-app deps task (tasks/scope-cross-app-deps.md) — natural next once a second app or system component exists.
